# How many chickens are slaughtered for meat each year?
subtitle: "Two hosts guess how many chickens are killed for meat each year, then shrink the answer to a size you can feel: per person and per second."
tags: ["food","biology","data"]
format: quiz
thumb: "band \"Count the chickens\" note \"per second?\""

## How many chickens are slaughtered for meat each year?
sources:
    - id: owid
      title: Yearly number of animals slaughtered for meat
      authors: Our World in Data, from FAO (2025)
      year: 2025
      url: https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/animals-slaughtered-for-meat
      finding: about 78.5 billion chickens slaughtered for meat worldwide in 2024 (6.6 billion in 1961); also 4.2 billion ducks, 1.5 billion pigs, 0.7 billion sheep, 0.6 billion goats, 0.5 billion turkeys, 0.3 billion cattle — chickens ≈ 91% of the total

